    {
      "title": "Test the tooling",
      "description": "## Test the tooling\n\n1. [Run the application](command:workbench.action.debug.start) if it isn't already running. \n\n1. Log out of the application if you're logged in and log in with Gmail.\n1. Accept the consent screen to allow the requested scopes.\n1. Now try a prompt like: _\"**Check my last unread email?**\"_\n1. If this is your first time authorizing the agent to look up emails on your behalf, you will be redirected to authorize the request. Once you complete this flow, you may have to issue the prompt again once you're redirected to the agent application.\n\nWhile you're waiting for a response, look at the terminal on this screen. You should see something similar to the output below logged:\n\n```\n[chat] request — messages: 1, threadID: abc123\n[chat] calling streamText...\n[chat] tool-call: gmailSearch\n[chat] tool-result: gmailSearch\n[chat] stream finished — finishReason: stop, tokens: {...}\n[chat] closing response\n```\n\n> Note: Make sure to use a Google account you added as a test user, otherwise the login will fail."
    },
    {
      "title": "Bonus: Draft an email",
      "description": "## Bonus: Draft an email\n\nIf you'd like to try the email composition tool, try this bonus activity!\n\n1. If it isn't already running, [run the application](command:workbench.action.debug.start).\n\n2. Ask Assistant0 to draft an email\n\n >\"Hey Assistant0, can you draft an email to **(insert an email address here)** to tell them I just completed the the AI Identity for Agentic SaaS lab? Mention that now I know how tool calling works and I'm very excited to know how to secure my AI apps with Auth0.\"\n\n\nThe expected behavior:\n\n- Recognize the intent to draft an email. Identify the recipient and the email as well as the core message - to talk about the lab and what was learned.\n- Use the `gmailCompose` tool to send the email.\n- Retrieve the Google access token using the Auth0 SDKs to send the email.\n\n3. Finally, check the Sent folder in your e-mail account to see the e-mail sent by Assistant0."
    },
    {
      "title": "Congratulations!",
      "description": "## Congratulations! 🎉🎉🎉\n\nNow Assistant0 has access to Gmail tooling.\n\nIn this lab you:\n\n- Used Auth0 AI SDKs to integrate your agent with Auth0 Token Vault.\n- Integrated tool calling with your agent application.\n- Set up your agent to call Google APIs on behalf of an authenticated user.\n"
    }
